## Full Demo Run Order

Each time you restart your machine, run services in this order:

**Terminal 1 — Backend**
```cmd
cd c:\Foundathon\techtitans\backend
node server.js
```

**Terminal 2 — AI Service**
```cmd
cd c:\Foundathon\techtitans\ai-service
venv\Scripts\uvicorn main:app --port 8001 --reload
```

**Terminal 3 — Blockchain Node**
```cmd
cd c:\Foundathon\techtitans\blockchain
npx hardhat node
```

**Terminal 4 — Deploy Contract** *(run once per node restart)*
```cmd
cd c:\Foundathon\techtitans\blockchain
npx hardhat run scripts/deploy.js --network localhost
```

**Terminal 5 — Frontend**
```cmd
cd c:\Foundathon\techtitans\frontend
npm run dev
```

Open **http://localhost:3000** 🎉

---

## To Enable AI Translation (Optional)

Get a free Gemini API key at [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com), then set it in `ai-service/.env`:
```
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
```
Restart the AI service. Without this key, matchmaking still works (local embeddings), but live translation and facilitation use fallback messages.

